@*
    OdsProfileTransparencyNote — the GDPR Art. 13 transparency notice shown at collection on BOTH
    profile surfaces (issue #316 §3 / design system profile-fields.jsx). States what the name
    broadcasts and why date of birth / sex are collected — visible only to the owner.
*@

<div class="pf-note" role="note">
    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Info" Class="pf-note-ic" />
    <div class="pf-note-body">
        <p><b>Your name</b> — your display name, or your first name — is shown to other people in this
            workspace on items you create.</p>
        <p><b>Date of birth and sex</b> are used for retirement and long-term financial planning, and are
            visible only to you.</p>
    </div>
</div>
